/-!
# Ado and general Lie III checks

The matrix Lie algebra `gl₂(ℝ)` has a nonzero triple bracket. The general
theorems construct a faithful representation and a simply connected integrating
group from its algebraic data alone. The empty matrix algebra checks dimension
zero, and the coordinate representation check works over any characteristic-zero
field.

Run `lake env lean scripts/CheckAdoLieIII.lean` after `lake build`.

